        <mxCell id="mapbox" value="随体坐标变换&#10;ξ = r / R(t) ∈ [0,1]&#10;(1/r)∂r(r·a·∂r φ) → 1/(R²ξ) · ∂ξ(ξ·a·∂ξ φ)" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
